        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARVER, Parthenon Plate With Versailles Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGrandeur's Parthenon Plate With Versailles Knob makes a profound statement in luxury. The rich detailing of the Parthenon Plate combined with the classically designed crystal Versailles Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the lustrous finish choices. The Versailles Knob is 24% lead crystal adding sparkle to the solid brass Parthenon Rose. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARVER Parthenon Plate With Crystal Versailles Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The Parthenon Plate is made out of solid forged brass and the Versailles Knob is 24% lead crystal.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Parthenon Plate With Versailles Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Versailles Knob Diameter: 2.30\"</li>\r\n<li>Versailles Knob Projection: 2.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-PARVER-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262185\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur PARVER Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Parthenon Plate With Versailles Knob, Grandeur PARVER",
                "description": "Parthenon Plate With Versailles Knob Grandeur PARVER - Grandeur's Parthenon Plate With Versailles Knob makes a profound statement in luxury. The rich detailing of the Parthenon Plate combined with the classically designed crystal Versailles Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the lustrous finish choices. The Versailles Knob is 24% lead crystal adding sparkle to the solid brass Parthenon Rose. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
